# saptta — AI-Powered HRMS & Recruitment Platform
# Environment Configuration
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# ✅ NO API KEYS REQUIRED TO RUN THIS PROJECT
#
# All AI features (resume analysis, chat assistant, JD generation)
# run 100% locally using built-in algorithms:
#   - Resume Analysis: TF-IDF + Cosine Similarity + Keyword Matching
#   - AI Chat: Rule-based NLP with intent classification
#   - JD Generation: Smart templates with dynamic field substitution
#   - Notifications: In-app notification center (no SMTP needed)
#   - Social Sharing: URL generators (no OAuth tokens needed)
#   - Authentication: Local demo auth (no NextAuth secret needed)
#
# Just run: npm install && npx prisma db push && npm run dev
# Then open: http://localhost:3000
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

DATABASE_URL=file:../db/custom.db
